{
  "abstract": "A Lean formalization of special transformations and RV lifting in algebraically closed valued fields of pure characteristic zero. The first Comparator configuration selects Theorem 5.5 and Corollary 5.6: special-bijection deformation to RV-pullbacks and preparation of polynomial RV values. Genuine saturation and a small original parameter set are explicit. Jacobian and measured-lifting results remain in the larger verified library but are outside this first submission claim.",
